  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Banana Pancakes.png|200px|left|Banana pancakes]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 94\n |price = 1 to 352\n |time = 1 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|bbqg|bigger|link=BBQ Grill}}\n |xp = 42\n |base = 98\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 51 min\n}}\n'''Banana pancakes''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 94.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making banana pancakes'''===\n[[File:BBQ Grill.png|150px|left|BBQ Grill]]\nBanana pancakes are made in the [[BBQ Grill]].\n\nTo make the pancakes, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Banana.png|75px|Banana|link=Banana]]\n|[[File:Blackberry.png|75px|Blackberries|link=Blackberry]]\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|Wheat|link=Wheat]]\n|[[File:Cream.png|75px|Cream|link=Cream]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make one unit, and 51 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] grill. Each unit gives players 42 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling banana pancakes'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Banana pancakes can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,528 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 pancakes.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make banana pancakes costs 327 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 banana pancakes per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Bananenpfannkuchen\n|es = Tortitas de plátano\n|fr = Pancakes à la Banane\n|it = Pancake alla banana\n|nl = Bananenpannenkoeken\n|no = Bananpannekaker\n|ru = Блины с бананами\n|zh = Banana Pancakes\n}}\n[[pt-br:Panqueca de banana]]\n\n[[Category:BBQ Grill Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Cream Products]]\n[[Category:Blackberry Products]]\n[[Category:Banana Products]]",
